new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b29ce42
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# Pong
+
+A simple two-player terminal Pong game built with the Python 3 standard library.
+
+## Play
+
+Run from the repository root in a terminal at least 62 columns by 23 rows:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m pong
+```
+
+The left paddle uses `w` and `s`. The right paddle uses the up and down arrow
+keys. Press `q` to quit. The first player to five points wins.
+
+## Test
+
+Run the unit tests and compile checks from the repository root:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -q
+python3 -m py_compile pong/*.py
+```
